What are we doing to bridge the gap from (A) to (B)
•
We are embarking on developing one of the world’s most ambitious green hydrogen 
ecosystems supported by a fully integrated value chain in one singe location including:
o 10 GW solar manufacturing capacity with supporting ancillaries;
o 5 GW wind turbine manufacturing capacity;
o 5 GW electrolyzer manufacturing capacity;
o In-house end to end EPC capabilities;
o Production of Green H2, Green ammonia and other derivatives with port infrastructure.

